                <div class="project-container">
                    
                    <p id="summary">SDL library for Android, including several games.</p>
                    
                    <p id="description">Port of SDL library to Android mobile platform.<br>
There are also several games inside the repository, along with their sources and build files.<br>
Both SDL 1.2 and 1.3/2.0 versions are supported (1.3/2.0 support is experimental)<br>
Sources are at <a href="https://github.com/pelya/commandergenius" rel="nofollow noopener">https://github.com/pelya/commandergenius</a></p>
